OL,3,GNEWSALondon Tube strike to go ahead
OL,4,Aafter talks fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrike action on the London Underground
OL,7,Fwill go ahead on Thursday, the Rail,
OL,8,FMaritime and Transport (RMT) union has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIt follows last-ditch talks between
OL,12,FTransport for London (TfL) and the
OL,13,Funion in an attempt to avoid a series
OL,14,Fof 24-hour strikes.
OL,16,FUnion members will walk out from noon
OL,17,Fon Thursday, with further walkouts
OL,18,Fplanned for 17 and 19 December, 4 and 6
OL,19,FJanuary, and 17, 23 and 25 February.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
