OL,3,GNEWSALondon Tube strike to go ahead
OL,4,Aafter talks fail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RMT said it was opposed to a
OL,7,Ffour-day working week, although the
OL,8,Fconditions have been accepted by the
OL,9,FAslef union. TfL said the changes were
OL,10,Fvoluntary and would lead to drivers
OL,11,Fworking fewer hours.
